  id: Scene05_FAQ_2
  speaker: WATTSON
  text: Electrons carry negative charge, so they drift from the negative terminal
    end toward the positive terminal end. Scientists also talk about conventional
    current, which is drawn from positive to negative. Same circuit, two ways of
    describing it.
